From 397bbb504ae36f6f7c12034be887dedf6234c4f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guild-Idler Patch Tool <patch@guild-idler.local>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:20:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0187: Raid narrative rewrite, clarity-first pass

Rewrite every raid's description and epilogue (8 raids) and every
encounter's flavour text (22 encounters) under the same clarity-first
house style introduced in patch 0186's quest chain rewrite. Also fixes
a stray first-person aside left in bonewrought_outer_wardens' flavour
text from an earlier draft.

No mechanical fields touched: raid ids, reqLevel, encounterIds,
requiredRoles, requiresChainId, unlocksRaidId, successModifier, banner
data, and every encounter's baseSuccess/durationHours/rewardGold/
rewardXp/loot tables are all unchanged. Pure content patch.
---
 guild-idler-status.md                   | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/game/data/json/raid-encounters.json | 44 ++++++++++++-------------
 src/game/data/json/raids.json           | 32 +++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 38 deletions(-)

